        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "Buildings are ornamentally studded with precious gems, and with such multi-storied sky scrappers she is adorned, and filled with them she is like Amaravati, the capital of Indra. [1-5-15]"
